{
  "data": {
    "about": "One of the founding members of the software company Key. Original creator and main composer of most of Key's visual novels.\n\nNotable works:\n\n- Kanon (Mai & Makoto routes)\n\n- Air\n\n- Clannad + After Story\n\n- Angel Beats!\n\n- Tomoyo After\n\n- Little Busters! + Refrain!\n\n- Charlotte\n\nBefore forming Key, Maeda worked for the company Tactics where he had a hand in the creation of two games for that company\n\n- Moon.\n\n- One: Kagayaku Kisetsu e\n\nOn February 10, 2022, he participated in the creation of the game \"Heaven Burns Red\" as a writer, scenario designer, composer, and lyricist, continuing his fictional world full of drama.\n\nThe central phrase of this game is \"最上の、切なさを\" (The ultimate sadness).",
    "alternate_names": [
      "Daamae",
      "だーまえ"
    ],
